RTIFICATIONS\n1.5+\nYEARS ACTIVE\n◈ CAPABILITIES\nSkills & Expertise\n\nTechnologies and security tools I work with to find vulnerabilities and build secure systems.\n\nNetwork Penetration Testing\n\nSECURITY\n\nADVANCED\nProficiency\n70%\nWeb Penetration Testing\n\nSECURITY\n\nINTERMEDIATE\nProficiency\n65%\nVulnerability Management\n\nSECURITY\n\nADVANCED\nProficiency\n70%\nPython\n\nPROGRAMMING\n\nADVANCED\nProficiency\n75%\nC++\n\nPROGRAMMING\n\nINTERMEDIATE\nProficiency\n50%\nNetworking\n\nSYSTEMS\n\nINTERMEDIATE\nProficiency\n60%\nLinux\n\nSYSTEMS\n\nEXPERT\nProficiency\n85%\nLog Analysis\n\nANALYSIS\n\nEXPERT\nProficiency\n90%\nWindows Server 2022\n\nSYSTEMS\n\nADVANCED\nProficiency\n70%\nDatabase Management\n\nSYSTEMS\n\nINTERMEDIATE\nProficiency\n65%\n2\nEXPERT SKILLS\n4\nADVANCED\n10\nTOTAL SKILLS\n31%\nAVG LEVEL\n◈ MY WORK\nFeatured Projects\n\nSecurity tools, exploits, and research projects built to enhance penetration testing and vulnerability discovery.\n\nBLUETEAM TOOL\n//\nBLUETEAM TOOL\nApache-logger\n\nApache log analyzer, lightweight log parser for cybersecurity analysts. Surfaces suspicious activity from raw access logs instantly.\n\nPython\nLog analysis\nCODE\nOFFENSIVE SECURITY\n//\nOFFENSIVE SECURITY\nInfostealer\n\nFully undetectable POC stealing browser passwords. Demonstrates credential extraction techniques for red team operations and security research.\n\nC++\nMalware\nRed-team Op\nCODE\nPOST-EXPLOITATION\n//\nPOST-EXPLOITATION\nGmail-Shell\n\nWindows-based C2 agent using Gmail as a covert command-and-control channel. Demonstrates creative post-exploitation techniques.\n\nPython\nPost-Exploitation\nCODE\nSOFTWARE\n//\nSOFTWARE\nSmartMedica\n\nWeb-based Software for small-medium sized clinics. Giving full environment tools needed in clinics\n\nPython\nSoftware\nNextJs\nCODE\nDEMO\n\nMORE PROJECTS ON GITHUB\n\nVIEW ALL ON GITHUB\n[RBN0x00]\n© 2026 RIADH BENLAMINE · SECURITY RESEARCHER\nGITHUB\nBLOG\nCONTACT",
